1
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,710
Raka starts a surf school
project and enters Nadia's brief.

2
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,590
The brief suggests concrete
questions from a curated library.

3
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:28,350
Gemini drafts an extra
question about lesson levels.

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,450
Raka reviews its options and
scope details before adding it.

5
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:34,390
AI never decides for them.

6
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,430
Raka locks the questions
and shares Nadia's link.

7
00:00:41,867 --> 00:00:43,637
Nadia opens her link on a phone.

8
00:00:48,667 --> 00:00:51,617
Raka answers independently
and seals his choices.

9
00:00:52,327 --> 00:00:53,637
Nadia cannot see them yet.

10
00:00:56,667 --> 00:00:59,057
Nadia selects her own answers and seals them.

11
00:00:59,447 --> 00:01:00,977
Only then are both sets revealed.

12
00:01:07,467 --> 00:01:09,017
Their booking answers differ.

13
00:01:09,367 --> 00:01:12,077
A WhatsApp conversation
versus instant reservations.

14
00:01:12,607 --> 00:01:14,477
The visual examples show the difference.

15
00:01:16,033 --> 00:01:18,603
Raka proposes WhatsApp booking for this project.

16
00:01:20,133 --> 00:01:22,423
Nadia counter-proposes a request form.

17
00:01:23,013 --> 00:01:25,963
Staff must confirm lesson availability
before accepting a booking.

18
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:30,930
Raka confirms. The earlier
proposal remains in history.

19
00:01:32,433 --> 00:01:34,923
Both people also confirm the matching answers.

20
00:01:35,293 --> 00:01:38,443
A matching answer alone never
becomes an agreed decision.

21
00:01:44,233 --> 00:01:48,363
ScopeMatch assembles the included
work, exclusions, responsibilities,

22
00:01:48,713 --> 00:01:50,083
and acceptance criteria.

23
00:01:50,593 --> 00:01:51,883
Raka sends version 1.

24
00:01:53,333 --> 00:01:55,703
Raka adds a note and saves version 2.

25
00:01:55,973 --> 00:01:57,823
The previous confirmation resets.

26
00:02:00,333 --> 00:02:02,403
Both confirm version 2 by name.

27
00:02:02,693 --> 00:02:05,643
Their confirmations now match
and the scope becomes agreed.

28
00:02:09,333 --> 00:02:12,303
He downloads Markdown and
opens the actual agreed file.

29
00:02:14,333 --> 00:02:17,283
Raka clicks Print / Save as PDF.

30
00:02:17,853 --> 00:02:20,563
The browser saves the agreed scope as a PDF.

31
00:02:21,113 --> 00:02:24,903
He opens that file and reviews the
document, including the decisions,

32
00:02:25,093 --> 00:02:27,883
acceptance criteria, and
both confirmation records.

